editor_description = "The regular dog half again as big: body, hit box, art (with its stride and how deep it sinks) and the checks at his feet. Its stats are the regular dog's with the distances to the man measured from its face, and it goes after him as he goes: it never gives up, jumps as high as he does and leaps down any drop. GateRing opens the gates set on Opens the first time the man comes inside it."
